# Everything here is generated by tools/build_site.py, which writes LF endings.
# Git on Windows defaults to converting the working tree to CRLF on checkout,
# which would make the very next rebuild rewrite every file back to LF and show
# the whole site as modified with no actual change in it. Pin the working tree to
# LF so a rebuild produces a diff only when the content really changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf  -text
*.jpg  -text
*.JPG  -text
*.webp -text
*.png  -text
